When using uiChatResource, reading its value after UI interaction and then creating a new uiChatResource (or structuredChatResource) with the previous messages causes an error. Additionally, if you restore a messages list where message.content is an object (the UI schema payload), provider calls to the LLM fail because they only accept string content. This breaks session restore/rehydration and chaining resources.

