Hello,
Starting from the latest dev-main version of Symfony AI, I'm getting HTTP Error 400 when trying to communicate with Google Gemini API with model 2.0 Flash.

Here are the error messages in the logs:
`[2025-09-15T12:50:20.575509+00:00] http_client.INFO: Request: "POST https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.0-flash:generateContent" [] []
